	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>Voters in Dracut can find all the information they need to participate fully in local and state elections, including guidance on registration, upcoming election dates, absentee and early voting, polling locations, and other key election resources. Whether you are voting for the first time or are a long-time resident, these tools and resources are designed to make the electoral process straightforward, accessible, and easy to navigate.</p>
    </div>

