        <h2 class="subhead1">Voting Information</h2><p>Find essential information on how, when, and where to vote in upcoming elections.</p><h3 class="subhead2">Election Calendar</h3><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/2971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Current Election Calendar (PDF)</a></p><h3 class="subhead2">Precinct Lookup</h3><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><a href="https://www.sec.state.ma.us/VoterRegistrationSearch/MyVoterRegStatus.aspx">Polling Locations Finder</a> <a href="/DocumentCenter/View/476" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a><br></p><p><br></p>
