<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor7d6631c4-daa1-44d7-957f-a384b17f451f" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1">Current Election Documents</h2><p>Stay informed with up-to-date election documents, including the current Election Warrant and Sample Ballot.</p><h3 class="subhead2">Election Warrant(s)</h3><p>Review the official Election Warrant(s), outlining the matters to be decided and the actions to be taken at the upcoming election.</p><h3 class="subhead2">Sample Ballot(s)</h3><p>View the Sample Ballot(s) to preview the candidates and questions that will appear on the ballot on Election Day.</p><p><br></p>
    </div>

